  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.4. Increased capacity of Member States to improve social dialogue and labour relations laws, processes and institutions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agency for Peaceful Settlement of Labour Disputes adopted a Manual on grievance mechanisms. The grievances manual will contribute to improving dispute resolutions by introducing grievance handling procedures and/or policies in 10 enterprises from relevant supply chains. A study and a Manual on grievance mechanisms developed, mediators and arbiters dealing with labour disputes trained by ILO. The grievances manual will contribute to improving dispute resolutions by introducing grievance handling procedures and/or policies in 10 enterprises from relevant supply chains</narrative>
   </description>
